<p>This article reminds me of a recurring dream i've had for years. Upvoting on the basis of that.</p>
<p>I don't really like the transcript part, though. It's long and pointless, filled with unnecessary and gratuituous amounts of what I call &quot;D-class-Who-Swear-Every-Other-Word-For-No-Good-Reason-Syndrome&quot;, and it doesn't really add anything. Condense it into a brief description like one of the first few logs of <a href="/scp-093">SCP-093</a> and you'll improve this article considerably.</p>
<p>Overall, +1.</p>

